#. ja: <sheet Item 2191 0>を装備してシルフ領の<sheet BNpcName 69 0>を討伐
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 2191 1 4 1></capitalize> anlegen und <noun-de BNpcName 5 69 2 4 1> besiegen
#. fr: Tuer <noun-fr BNpcName 1 69 2 1> avec <noun-fr Item 2 2191 1 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/011/JobSmn001_01126:TEXT_JOBSMN001_01126_TODO_09:1"
